  {
    "id": "oilselfie",
    "title": "Oil Selfie",
    "year": "2026",
    "description": "A series of self portraits in oil painted from aggressive flash selfies. The pictures are scrambled, glitched and remixed through various apps. This method of image processing was for a long time before the powers of hormone replacement therapy a portal to witnessing myself as I wanted to reach be it genderswap filters or messing with the image till I recognized myself.",

